    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769700/extras/bfec91476cd814e9833dd7d7a9d441a3.avif?t=1743480942\" width=257 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO STYLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO SUBSTANCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUST PEAK\u00a0\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast and crash through hordes of <strong><i><u>Hell</u></i></strong>'s strongest warriors as a (Human? Statue?? Creature???) <strong><i><u>Goofy Goober</u></i></strong> fighting through all rings of the iconic down-under for <strong><i><u>Revengeance</u></i></strong> of <strong><i><u>unknown proportion</u></i></strong>. One thing is certain: There Will be <u><strong><i>Blood Shed</i></strong></u>. Grab a weapon, equip an item and slice through <strong><i><u>Twin Raging Titans, Ghastly Apparitions, Big Tank,</u></i></strong> and <strong><i><u>Lil' Scratchy</u></i></strong>. What lies at the end of these Wacky Hijinks..?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There might also be a <strong><i><u>Fishing Minigame</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I <strong><i><u>don't</u></i></strong> really <strong><i><u>know</u></i></strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769700/extras/d0bac85bd748130a7630c4cffd5a7ff3.avif?t=1743480942\" width=297 height=97 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling roguelike gameplay to the darkest depths of <strong><i><u>Hell</u></i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable skins and costumes to personalize your very own Goober</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting challenges to spice up regular gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of enemies and bosses bent on stopping your scrummage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Song OST to get your blood PUMPING</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769700/extras/95850243ab374f607a9ea3a29d176e55.poster.avif?t=1743480942\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769700/extras/95850243ab374f607a9ea3a29d176e55.apng?t=1743480942\" class=\"bb_img\" width=84 height=70 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769700/extras/bfec91476cd814e9833dd7d7a9d441a3.avif?t=1743480942\" width=257 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO STYLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO SUBSTANCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUST PEAK\u00a0\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast and crash through hordes of <strong><i><u>Hell</u></i></strong>'s strongest warriors as a (Human? Statue?? Creature???) <strong><i><u>Goofy Goober</u></i></strong> fighting through all rings of the iconic down-under for <strong><i><u>Revengeance</u></i></strong> of <strong><i><u>unknown proportion</u></i></strong>. One thing is certain: There Will be <u><strong><i>Blood Shed</i></strong></u>. Grab a weapon, equip an item and slice through <strong><i><u>Twin Raging Titans, Ghastly Apparitions, Big Tank,</u></i></strong> and <strong><i><u>Lil' Scratchy</u></i></strong>. What lies at the end of these Wacky Hijinks..?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There might also be a <strong><i><u>Fishing Minigame</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I <strong><i><u>don't</u></i></strong> really <strong><i><u>know</u></i></strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769700/extras/d0bac85bd748130a7630c4cffd5a7ff3.avif?t=1743480942\" width=297 height=97 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling roguelike gameplay to the darkest depths of <strong><i><u>Hell</u></i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable skins and costumes to personalize your very own Goober</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting challenges to spice up regular gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of enemies and bosses bent on stopping your scrummage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Song OST to get your blood PUMPING</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769700/extras/95850243ab374f607a9ea3a29d176e55.poster.avif?t=1743480942\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769700/extras/95850243ab374f607a9ea3a29d176e55.apng?t=1743480942\" class=\"bb_img\" width=84 height=70 /></picture></span></p>",
